Subject: [PATCH 01/15] Local: switch t3code-customize features on and off in
 Settings
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Settings → General → Customizations lists every t3code-customize feature built into the app, each with a switch. The switches are stored in a customizations server setting, so server features can follow them too, and a feature without an entry is on. Each patch adds its own file under apps/web/src/customizations/features, so the list shows only the patches that are applied.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
